OL,3,GNEWSAMultimillion-pound A38 scheme
OL,4,Ashelved by government
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday the government confirmed it
OL,7,Fhad decided to "prioritise crucial
OL,8,Finvestment to our national defence, now
OL,9,Fand for the future".
